<view class="page order-page">
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="eyebrow">有赞订单匹配</view>
    <view class="h1">找到你的试饮订单</view>
    <view class="body">输入下单时填写的手机号。登录手机号和收货手机号可以不同。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section panel">
    <view class="form-label">收货手机号</view>
    <input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhoneInput" placeholder="请输入收货手机号" />
    <button class="btn match-btn" bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}">确认订单</button>
    <view class="body hint">订单送达后才能启动 Day1。若微信手机号和收货手机号不同，请以收货手机号为准。</view>
  </view>
</view>
